The '''Mother Jungle''' was the vast [[Forest|rain forest]] ecosystem that covered the surface of the [[planet]] [[Ithor]]. The [[Homeworld|native]] [[Ithorian]]s considered it most sacred, and forbade to set foot within it. Their reverence, however, left the Mother Jungle vulnerable to exploitation. By the time of the [[New Republic]], the [[Sector Ranger]]s suspected the existence of a rogue Ithorian organization offering big game [[hunting]] expeditions.<ref name="Scum and Villainy Case Files" /> The [[Dowutin]] [[mercenary]] [[Grummgar]] once took part in one such expedition.<ref name="Bait">{{InsiderCite|162|Bait}}</ref>

